From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:11:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/27] Mobile: Fix the shopping list suggestion row and tile
 size

The suggestion chips keep their natural height (they were squeezed away
by the keyboard and blown up on empty lists), taps work while the
keyboard is open, and tiles default to four columns with pinch zoom
between three and six. Catalog fixes: "Hafer", nuts and dried fruit.

